Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:34.74,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 1/4决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:34.74,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}佩古拉 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}4 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}2-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}7-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}6(4){\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 阿尼西莫娃 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.56,0:00:09.24,EN,,0,0,0,,And our set comes to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.56,0:00:09.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一盘结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.24,0:00:10.76,EN,,0,0,0,,A 2hour 15 match,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.24,0:00:10.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,两小时十五分钟的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:13.32,EN,,0,0,0,,but it's the same result again and again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:13.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,结果却一次又一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:16.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and again for Pigula against Anisimova.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:16.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,一样 佩古拉对阿尼西莫娃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:19.40,EN,,0,0,0,,It's six love in terms
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:19.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,两人的交手战绩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:20.68,EN,,0,0,0,,of head-to-head meetings
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:20.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,已经来到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.68,0:00:23.00,EN,,0,0,0,,between the two good friends
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.68,0:00:23.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,六比零
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:26.68,EN,,0,0,0,,on and off the court, but only one winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:26.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,场下是朋友 场上只有一人赢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.68,0:00:28.44,EN,,0,0,0,,And it's a semifinal place
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.68,0:00:28.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:31.64,EN,,0,0,0,,for the second time in three years in Cincy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:31.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,三年两次杀进辛辛那提半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:34.68,EN,,0,0,0,,for Jesse Beula edging the tie break
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:34.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,决胜盘抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:37.32,EN,,0,0,0,,against Anisimo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:37.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,险胜阿尼西莫娃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.32,0:00:40.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I will survive and you did by just the skin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.32,0:00:40.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一定会活下来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:41.32,EN,,0,0,0,,of your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:41.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,而你这次是死里逃生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.32,0:00:43.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Jess, how does it feel to get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.32,0:00:43.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,杰西 这么艰难的一场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.08,0:00:44.44,EN,,0,0,0,,through a tough match like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.08,0:00:44.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,拿下来是什么感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:46.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean Amanda's an amazing player,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:46.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,阿曼达是个很厉害的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:47.96,EN,,0,0,0,,an amazing ball striker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:47.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,击球质量特别高
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:49.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I know that I have a good record
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:49.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道我对她战绩不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:51.16,EN,,0,0,0,,against her, but it literally every single
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:51.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,但基本上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:52.84,EN,,0,0,0,,match is pretty much like it was today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:52.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一场都打得像今天这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:55.56,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I know that I have to, like you say,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:55.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以就像你说的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.56,0:00:56.44,EN,,0,0,0,,try and survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.56,0:00:56.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得想办法活下来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.44,0:00:59.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Sometimes she can play lights out tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.44,0:00:59.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,她状态好的时候真的打不过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:00.52,EN,,0,0,0,,where there's not much you can do like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:00.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你什么都做不了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.52,0:01:01.72,EN,,0,0,0,,in the second set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.52,0:01:01.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,像第二盘那样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.32,EN,,0,0,0,,But I think I was able
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我觉得我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.32,0:01:05.32,EN,,0,0,0,,to to start getting some momentum
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.32,0:01:05.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,在那一盘快结束时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.32,0:01:06.68,EN,,0,0,0,,at the end of that set and then take it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.32,0:01:06.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,找回了一点势头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.68,0:01:08.36,EN,,0,0,0,,into the third and kind of get ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.68,0:01:08.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,带进决胜盘 慢慢占了上风
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.36,0:01:10.36,EN,,0,0,0,,but it was still wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.36,0:01:10.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,但那还不够
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.36,0:01:11.80,EN,,0,0,0,,But, I got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.36,0:01:11.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,好在最后拿下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.80,0:01:13.48,EN,,0,0,0,,It was a go big or go home match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.80,0:01:13.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是一场孤注一掷的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.48,0:01:14.52,EN,,0,0,0,,You came out the third set,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.48,0:01:14.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,决胜盘一开始
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.52,0:01:16.04,EN,,0,0,0,,looks like you were taking the ball like a half
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.52,0:01:16.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,你出手好像提前了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.04,0:01:17.80,EN,,0,0,0,,a second earlier in order to get ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.04,0:01:17.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,半秒 想要抢占先机
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.80,0:01:19.48,EN,,0,0,0,,but then if you blink your eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.80,0:01:19.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,但只要一眨眼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:20.60,EN,,0,0,0,,she catches back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:20.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,她又追回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:21.96,EN,,0,0,0,,What do you think was the key today?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:21.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天赢球的关键是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.96,0:01:24.36,EN,,0,0,0,,It really was just a game of margins
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.96,0:01:24.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的就是分毫之差的较量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.36,0:01:27.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and a big butterfly just flew onto my head
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.36,0:01:27.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,一只大蝴蝶刚刚飞到我头上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:28.12,EN,,0,0,0,,in that interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:28.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在这段采访里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.12,0:01:30.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I it's like you said,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.12,0:01:30.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,没错 就像你说的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.36,0:01:34.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I I really have to not let her ball play me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.36,0:01:34.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的不能被她的球牵着走
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:35.32,EN,,0,0,0,,but I'm pretty sure she's one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:35.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,她应该是巡回赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.24,EN,,0,0,0,,of the if not the hardest hitter on tour,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,击球最重的那几个人之一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:38.84,EN,,0,0,0,,so that's very hard to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:38.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这真的很难做到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.84,0:01:40.68,EN,,0,0,0,,But I I think it's one of my skills
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.84,0:01:40.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我觉得这正是我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:41.96,EN,,0,0,0,,that I'm pretty good at.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:41.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,比较擅长的一项能力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:44.12,EN,,0,0,0,,So, you really have to to not let
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:44.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,不能让她
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.12,0:01:45.48,EN,,0,0,0,,her push you around the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.12,0:01:45.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,把你满场调动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.48,0:01:46.44,EN,,0,0,0,,And when you do, you kind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.48,0:01:46.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,一旦被她牵着走
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.44,0:01:48.04,EN,,0,0,0,,of have to absorb the pace and do as much
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.44,0:01:48.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,就得尽量卸掉她的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:50.60,EN,,0,0,0,,as you can to kind of not let her set up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:50.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,不能让她轻易架起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.60,0:01:51.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and and rip her shots,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.60,0:01:51.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,打出那种重炮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:53.32,EN,,0,0,0,,which again is very, very hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:53.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,这同样非常难
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.32,0:01:55.00,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, I was trying
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.32,0:01:55.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我就想着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.00,0:01:56.28,EN,,0,0,0,,to play a little bit more aggressive,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.00,0:01:56.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得更主动一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:01:57.80,EN,,0,0,0,,get my feet, get my body weight kind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:01:57.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,让脚步和身体重心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.80,0:01:59.00,EN,,0,0,0,,of moving into the court a little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.80,0:01:59.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,更往场内压一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:01:59.72,EN,,0,0,0,,at the start of the third,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:01:59.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,决胜盘一开局就这么打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.72,0:02:01.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think I started playing much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.72,0:02:01.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉状态一下就上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.40,0:02:03.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Next up, Iga or Elena.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.40,0:02:03.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,下一轮 斯瓦泰克或莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.48,0:02:04.68,EN,,0,0,0,,A, will you watch tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.48,0:02:04.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今晚会看这场球吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.68,0:02:06.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and be you're one of the few players
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.68,0:02:06.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你可是少数
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.12,0:02:07.72,EN,,0,0,0,,who has been able to beat both of them
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.12,0:02:07.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,两个人都赢过的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.72,0:02:08.36,EN,,0,0,0,,before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.72,0:02:08.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,之一
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:10.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Although they are tough ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:10.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,虽然她们都不好打
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:12.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean I haven't beaten them
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:12.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过我今年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.12,0:02:15.24,EN,,0,0,0,,this year so it's it's always a tough task
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.12,0:02:15.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,还没赢过她们 一直很难打
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.24,0:02:16.60,EN,,0,0,0,,but hey they're the top players.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.24,0:02:16.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,但她们确实是顶尖选手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:18.76,EN,,0,0,0,,You know we're all top 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:18.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们都排在前十
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:20.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I think the rankings honestly
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:20.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,老实说我觉得排名
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:21.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to me don't mean much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:21.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说没那么重要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.48,0:02:21.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I think
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.48,0:02:21.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,其实
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.96,0:02:24.04,EN,,0,0,0,,we're we're barely separated out here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.96,0:02:24.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,站到场上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.04,0:02:25.48,EN,,0,0,0,,when we come out on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.04,0:02:25.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,大家其实差不了多少
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.48,0:02:26.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Everyone is really tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.48,0:02:26.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,每个人都很难对付
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.36,0:02:27.72,EN,,0,0,0,,So it's going to be a great match tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.36,0:02:27.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚这场应该会很精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:29.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'll tune in and try my best
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:29.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我肯定会看 也会尽量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:30.60,EN,,0,0,0,,to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:30.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,好好恢复一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.60,0:02:31.96,EN,,0,0,0,,All right. We wish you the best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.60,0:02:31.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:34.74,EN,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, Jessica Pagoula.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:34.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,有请 杰西卡·佩古拉
